---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { company } from '../data/site';
---
<Base
  title="Privacy Policy | Integpro"
  description="Explore IntegPRO's privacy policy outlining our commitment to data protection while offering expert ISO consulting and auditing services across Australia. Trust us for secure, compliant, and reliable management systems solutions."
>
  <section class="intro">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p>Welcome to integPRO’s Privacy Policy. Effective from 17 April 2025, this policy outlines how integPRO Pty Ltd (“integPRO”, “we”, “us”, or “our”) collects, uses, stores, and safeguards your personal information. In compliance with the requirements of the Privacy Act 1988 (Cth) and the Australian Privacy Principles (APPs), our aim is to provide transparency, ensure your privacy is respected, and clearly explain your rights and how your data is managed when you interact with us or use our services</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <article class="policy">
    <section>
      <h2>Effective Date: 17/04/2025</h2>
      <p>At integPRO Pty Ltd ("integPRO", "we", "us", or "our"), we are committed to protecting the privacy of individuals and managing personal information in an open and transparent way. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, store, and protect your personal information in accordance with the Privacy Act 1988 (Cth) and the Australian Privacy Principles (APPs).</p>
      <p>By using our website (<a href="/">www.integpro.com.au</a>), engaging with us via email, phone, or other communication channels, or using our services, you consent to the practices described in this policy.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>1. What Information We Collect</h2>
      <p class="tight">We may collect the following types of personal information:</p>
      <p class="tight">a. Contact Information</p>
      <ul><li>Name</li><li>Company name</li><li>Email address</li><li>Phone number</li><li>Postal and/or business address</li></ul>
      <p class="tight">b. Business-Related Information</p>
      <ul><li>Business structure and processes</li><li>Management system details</li><li>Regulatory compliance information</li><li>Project-related communications</li></ul>
      <p class="tight">c. Website Usage Data</p>
      <ul><li>IP address</li><li>Browser type and version</li><li>Pages visited and time spent</li><li>Referring website</li><li>Cookies and other tracking technologies</li></ul>
      <p>d. Sensitive Information We generally do not collect sensitive information unless it is necessary for our services and you have given consent. Sensitive information may include details related to racial or ethnic origin, membership of professional associations, or criminal records.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>2. How We Collect Information</h2>
      <p>We may collect your information through:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Direct contact (e.g., phone calls, online forms, emails, meetings)</li>
        <li>Website submissions (e.g., contact forms or subscription sign-ups)</li>
        <li>Networking events, conferences, or sponsorship interactions</li>
        <li>Third-party service providers or partners (with your consent)</li>
        <li>Public sources or directories (e.g., business websites or LinkedIn)</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>3. Why We Collect Your Information</h2>
      <p>We collect and use personal information for the following purposes:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>To provide and manage our services</li>
        <li>To communicate with you about projects, updates, or inquiries</li>
        <li>To deliver proposals, quotes, or reports</li>
        <li>To meet legal, regulatory, or contractual obligations</li>
        <li>For marketing, promotion, and event-related communication (only with your consent)</li>
        <li>To improve our website, services, and client experience</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>4. Disclosure of Personal Information</h2>
      <p>We may disclose your personal information to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Our employees, contractors, and consultants (on a need-to-know basis)</li>
        <li>Professional advisers (e.g., legal, accounting, or IT support)</li>
        <li>Third-party service providers (e.g., website hosting, analytics, cloud storage)</li>
        <li>Regulatory bodies, government agencies, or legal entities (where required by law)</li>
        <li>Partners or affiliates involved in joint projects (with your consent)</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We will not sell, rent, or trade your personal information to third parties.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>5. Data Security</h2>
      <p>We take reasonable steps to protect your personal information from misuse, interference, loss, unauthorized access, modification, or disclosure. Measures include:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Secure storage systems and access controls</li>
        <li>Encryption for data transmission where appropriate</li>
        <li>Regular system updates and data backups</li>
        <li>Staff training and confidentiality agreements</li>
      </ul>
      <p>While we strive to protect your data, no system is 100% secure. Please contact us immediately if you suspect a breach.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>6. Access to and Correction of Your Information</h2>
      <p>You have the right to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Access your personal information held by us</li>
        <li>Request correction of inaccurate, out-of-date, or incomplete information</li>
      </ul>
      <p>To make a request, please contact us using the details below. We may require proof of identity. In most cases, we will respond within 30 days.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>7. Cookies and Tracking Technologies</h2>
      <p>Our website uses cookies and similar technologies to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Improve user experience and site performance</li>
        <li>Analyze traffic and trends</li>
        <li>Remember user preferences</li>
      </ul>
      <p>You can manage cookie settings through your browser preferences. Some features of our site may not work properly if cookies are disabled.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>8. Third-Party Links</h2>
      <p>Our website may contain links to third-party websites. We are not responsible for the privacy practices or content of these external sites. We encourage you to read their privacy policies before providing any personal information.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>9. Marketing Communications</h2>
      <p>With your consent, we may send you emails or newsletters about our services, updates, or events. You can unsubscribe at any time using the link in the email or by contacting us.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>10. International Data Transfers</h2>
      <p>We do not generally transfer personal information overseas. If we do, we will take reasonable steps to ensure the recipient complies with privacy laws or has equivalent safeguards in place.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>11. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes in our practices, technology, or legal requirements. The latest version will always be available on our website, and we encourage you to review it periodically.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>12. Contact Us</h2>
      <p class="tight">If you have any questions, concerns, or complaints about this Privacy Policy or our handling of your personal information, please contact:</p>
      <address>
        integPRO Pty Ltd<br />
        Email: <a href={`mailto:${company.email}`}>{company.email}</a><br />
        Phone: <a href={`tel:${company.phone.replace(/\s/g, '')}`}>{company.phone}</a>
      </address>
    </section>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .intro { padding: 76px 0 40px; }
  .intro h1 { text-align: center; font-size: 60px; line-height: 72px; color: var(--gold); }
  .intro p { margin: 4px 0 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 22.4px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; }

  .policy { width: min(604px, 100% - 32px); margin: 50px auto 120px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 22.4px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; }
  .policy section + section { margin-top: 60px; }
  h2 { font-size: 20px; line-height: 27px; color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 4px; }
  p { margin: 0 0 22px; }
  p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .tight { margin-bottom: 0; }
  ul { margin: 0 0 22px; padding-left: 29px; }
  ul:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  a { text-decoration: underline; }
  address { font-style: normal; }
  address a { text-decoration: none; }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .intro { padding-top: 48px; }
    .intro h1 { font-size: 40px; line-height: 48px; }
    .policy { margin-top: 32px; }
    .policy section + section { margin-top: 44px; }
  }
</style>
